port shells/oksh
type port
reason "DragonFly: ports ncurses keeps setupterm/cur_term in libtinfo"
target @any

# dragonfly/@2026Q4, @main: configure probes curses by linking
# -lncurses alone. The ports libncurses.so is a linker script that pulls in
# libtinfo, but the static flavor links libncurses.a, which lacks
# setupterm(), so the probe failed, NO_CURSES was set, and emacs.c/vi.c
# still used cur_term. Link -ltinfo explicitly.
